><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/19781b523858b732d164ff6a718a8c65041c338b-512x512.avif?w=512&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="iimarbella logo" width="512" height="512" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/936866fe58f09b62ada4cdbf319176f5dcce9f15-261x98.webp?w=261&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="vadim eyewear logo" width="261" height="98" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/690df68b76dbc228fba092407207caedc24a07fb-261x54.svg?w=261&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="pro science logo" width="261" height="54" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/ef0e7944efc0b3f7652c57ac775c681ff67477ed-249x64.svg?w=249&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="cash4car logo" width="249" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" class="difference" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/f2d294031922c374c1697ba65ecc9d0d58fc67bd-411x103.svg?w=411&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="deky expo logo" width="411" height="103" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="content-grid section feature" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="block-inner" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="feature-layout has-media" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg><div class="copy" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg><h2 id="aplikacje-nie-wspolpracuja-wiec-handlowiec-robi-za-integracje" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg="true">Aplikacje nie współpracują, więc handlowiec robi za integrację</h2><div class="pt prose flow" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><p data-astro-cid-6amch4or="true">Lead trafia do CRM z opóźnieniem. Oferta powstaje z cennika, historii maili i notatek ze spotkania. Follow-up wychodzi, kiedy ktoś o nim pamięta. Każdy używa AI po swojemu. Narzędzia są kupione, ale praca nadal przechodzi ręcznie przez zespół.</p></div></div><figure class="media" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg><div class="dg" data-diagram="zw-manual-relay" aria-hidden="true" style="--dg-w: 760; --dg-h: 258;"><div class="zw-stage dg-stage"><div class="zw-fit dg-fit"><div class="zw-scene"><div class="mr-board"><div class="mr-apps"><div class="mr-app" data-app="0"><span class="mr-tick"><span class="mr-tick-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M12 7.5V12l3 2"></path></svg></span><span class="mr-tick-txt">&plus;2h</span></span><span class="mr-app-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3.6 7l8.4 6 8.4-6"></path></svg></span><span class="mr-app-label">Email</span></div><div class="mr-gap"><span class="mr-break"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="11" height="11" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M7 7l10 10M17 7L7 17"></path></svg></span></div><div class="mr-app" data-app="1"><span class="mr-tick"><span class="mr-tick-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M12 7.5V12l3 2"></path></svg></span><span class="mr-tick-txt">&plus;1d</span></span><span class="mr-app-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.6 13.4l-7.2 7.2a2 2 0 0 1-2.8 0L3.8 13.6V4H13z"></path><circle cx="7.7" cy="7.7" r="1.3"></circle></svg></span><span class="mr-app-label">Pricebook</span></div><div class="mr-gap"><span class="mr-break"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="11" height="11" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M7 7l10 10M17 7L7 17"></path></svg></span></div><div class="mr-app" data-app="2"><span class="mr-tick"><span class="mr-tick-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M12 7.5V12l3 2"></path></svg></span><span class="mr-tick-txt">&plus;4h</span></span><span class="mr-app-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3.2" y="4" width="4.6" height="16" rx="1.2"></rect><rect x="9.7" y="4" width="4.6" height="11" rx="1.2"></rect><rect x="16.2" y="4" width="4.6" height="13" rx="1.2"></rect></svg></span><span class="mr-app-label">CRM</span></div><div class="mr-gap"><span class="mr-break"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="11" height="11" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M7 7l10 10M17 7L7 17"></path></svg></span></div><div class="mr-app" data-app="3"><span class="mr-tick"><span class="mr-tick-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"></circle><path d="M12 7.5V12l3 2"></path></svg></span><span class="mr-tick-txt">&plus;2h</span></span><span class="mr-app-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3.2l1.7 4.9 4.9 1.7-4.9 1.7L12 16.4l-1.7-4.9L5.4 9.8l4.9-1.7z"></path><path d="M18.6 15.4l.6 1.8 1.8.6-1.8.6-.6 1.8-.6-1.8-1.8-.6 1.8-.6z"></path></svg></span><span class="mr-app-label">AI</span></div></div><div class="mr-worker"><span class="mr-avatar"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.4"></circle><path d="M5.6 19.4a6.4 6.4 0 0 1 12.8 0"></path></svg></span><span class="mr-carry"><span class="mr-stack-card"></span><span class="mr-stack-card"></span><span class="mr-stack-card"></span><span class="mr-packet"><span class="mr-packet-line"></span><span class="mr-packet-line"></span></span></span><span class="mr-manual-tag">Manual</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><script type="module" src="/_astro/ZwManualRelay.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.DrZkrk1u.js"></script></figure></div></div></section><section class="content-grid section logo-strip" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="block-inner" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="logos" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><header class="head" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><p class="type-body intro" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424>Łączę narzędzia, z których zespół już korzysta</p></header><ul aria-label="Łączę narzędzia, z których zespół już korzysta" class="logo-grid tools" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><li tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/95ea9fe7a941fdc2d0e313337f903ccaa7ead0a2-209x49.svg?w=209&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="logo pipedrive" width="209" height="49" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/f25f052a658c224cb9ff487ee617d07de9627468-960x672.webp?w=960&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="salesforce logo" width="960" height="672" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/18805c2b531647af7d56851d5e80793dbd4d3e0b-256x64.webp?w=256&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="attio logo" width="256" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/fb27eac693a531a987af7de1e3b59f51174bd02f-1000x198.svg?w=1000&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="logo asana" width="1000" height="198" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/29c7411b266c25675b7495479ddca6e0347f4edc-694x219.webp?w=694&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="clay logo" width="694" height="219" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/978830ebfa4eae81c061abd326de52ac6b7a8579-1280x512.webp?w=1280&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="n8n logo" width="1280" height="512" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/c62b871baef624e7b858d10220a71681d64e3b53-3840x1042.webp?w=1600&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="openai logo" width="1600" height="434" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li><li tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424><img src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/8u2zjhvn/production/64f2df71c3096755b47612b2ef9c2640f0e5e778-3000x2000.avif?w=1600&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format" alt="anthropic logo" width="1600" height="1067" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-7hzkb424></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="content-grid section content-section" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="block-inner" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="content-layout" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><header class="intro" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><h2 id="skad-wiedziec-ze-to-dobry-moment-na-wspolprace" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo>Skąd wiedzieć, że to dobry moment na współpracę?</h2><div class="pt prose flow" data-astro-cid-6amch4or></div></header><ul class="items checklist" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><li data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-astro-cid-zgufigjl><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6" data-astro-cid-zgufigjl></path></svg><div class="item-copy" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><h3 id="dane-o-kliencie-sa-rozproszone-miedzy-crm-poczta-i-dokumentami-excelami" class="type-heading-xs" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo>Dane o kliencie są rozproszone między CRM, pocztą i dokumentami, excelami.</h3></div></li><li data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-astro-cid-zgufigjl><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6" data-astro-cid-zgufigjl></path></svg><div class="item-copy" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><h3 id="handlowcy-recznie-przygotowuja-oferty-raporty-i-follow-upy-listy-potencjalnych-klientow-research" class="type-heading-xs" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo>Handlowcy ręcznie przygotowują oferty, raporty i follow-upy, listy potencjalnych klientów, research.</h3></div></li><li data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-astro-cid-zgufigjl><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6" data-astro-cid-zgufigjl></path></svg><div class="item-copy" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><h3 id="wiedza-o-skutecznych-sposobach-pracy-zostaje-u-pojedynczych-osob-kazdy-sprzedaje-inaczej" class="type-heading-xs" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo>Wiedza o skutecznych sposobach pracy zostaje u pojedynczych osób. Każdy sprzedaje inaczej.</h3></div></li><li data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-astro-cid-zgufigjl><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6" data-astro-cid-zgufigjl></path></svg><div class="item-copy" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><h3 id="nie-jestes-w-stanie-zmierzyc-czy-zmiany-jakie-wprowadzasz-w-sprzedazy-sa-dobre" class="type-heading-xs" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo>Nie jesteś w stanie zmierzyć czy zmiany jakie wprowadzasz w sprzedaży są dobre.</h3></div></li></ul></div></div></section><section class="content-grid section content-section" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="block-inner" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="content-layout" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><header class="intro" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><h2 id="zacznijmy-od-miejsca-ktore-dzis-najbardziej-blokuje-prace-zespolu" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo>Zacznijmy od miejsca, które dziś najbardziej blokuje pracę zespołu</h2><div class="pt prose flow" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><p data-astro-cid-6amch4or="true">Mogę uporządkować CRM, połączyć używane narzędzia automatyzacjami, wdrożyć agentów AI albo zbudować system pracy w Asana. Poniżej zobaczysz, jaki problem rozwiązuje każda z tych usług i od czego możemy zacząć.</p></div><nav class="inline-links" aria-label="Zacznijmy od miejsca, które dziś najbardziej blokuje pracę zespołu" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo><a href="#crm" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo>CRM</a><a href="#ai" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo>AI dla sprzedaży</a><a href="#automatyzacja" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo>Automatyzacja</a><a href="#asana" data-astro-cid-7yq64bwo>Asana</a></nav></header></div></div></section><section id="crm" class="content-grid section feature" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="block-inner" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="feature-layout has-media" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg><div class="copy" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg><h2 id="crm-dla-zespolu-sprzedazy" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg="true">CRM dla zespołu sprzedaży</h2><div class="pt prose flow" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><p data-astro-cid-6amch4or="true">Projektuję proces, konfiguruję Pipedrive, porządkuję dane i szkolę zespół. CRM ma pomagać handlowcom w pracy i dawać managerowi wiarygodny obraz sprzedaży.<br>CRM, który wspiera handlowców i pokazuje prawdziwy stan sprzedaży</p></div><a class="action text" href="/szkolenie-i-wdrozenie-pipedrive" data-astro-cid-j6ocf6pu><span data-astro-cid-j6ocf6pu>Zobacz ofertę wdrożenia Pipedrive</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-astro-cid-zgufigjl><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6" data-astro-cid-zgufigjl></path></svg></a></div><figure class="media" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg><div class="dg" data-diagram="crm-funnel" aria-hidden="true" style="--dg-w: 760; --dg-h: 177;"><div class="cf-stage dg-stage"><div class="cf-fit dg-fit"><div class="cf-lanes"><div class="cf-lane" data-count="5"><div class="cf-lane-head"><span class="cf-lane-label">Lead</span><span class="cf-chip">5</span></div><div class="cf-ghost"><span></span><span></span></div><div class="cf-ghost"><span></span><span></span></div></div><div class="cf-lane" data-count="3"><div class="cf-lane-head"><span class="cf-lane-label">Qualified</span><span class="cf-chip">3</span></div><div class="cf-ghost"><span></span><span></span></div><div class="cf-ghost"><span></span><span></span></div></div><div class="cf-lane" data-count="2"><div class="cf-lane-head"><span class="cf-lane-label">Proposal</span><span class="cf-chip">2</span></div><div class="cf-ghost"><span></span><span></span></div></div><div class="cf-lane cf-lane--won" data-count="0"><div class="cf-lane-head"><span class="cf-lane-label">Won</span><span class="cf-chip">0</span></div></div><div class="cf-mover"><div class="cf-deal"><div class="cf-deal-top"><span class="cf-avatar">A</span><span class="cf-deal-name">Acme</span><span class="cf-deal-check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14"><path d="M5 12.5l4.2 4.3L19 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></div><div class="cf-deal-value">&euro;24,000</div><div class="cf-deal-foot"><span class="cf-tag">New deal</span></div></div></div><div class="cf-confetti"></div></div></div></div></div><script type="module" src="/_astro/CrmFunnel.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.DcMJKdsx.js"></script></figure></div></div></section><section id="ai" class="content-grid section feature" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="block-inner" data-astro-cid-7wj36s4i><div class="feature-layout has-media" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg><div class="copy" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg><h2 id="wdrozenie-ai-oparte-na-procesie-i-danych-firmy" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg="true">Wdrożenie AI oparte na procesie i danych firmy</h2><div class="pt prose flow" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><p data-astro-cid-6amch4or="true">Wybieram powtarzalną pracę, która rzeczywiście zabiera czas: przygotowanie oferty, follow-up, briefing przed spotkaniem albo porządkowanie CRM. Buduję kontekst firmy, łączę agenta z aktualnymi danymi i szkolę zespół na realnych przypadkach.<br>Agenci AI do ofert, follow-upów i briefingu, podłączeni do danych w CRM</p></div><a class="action text" href="/wdrozenie-ai-w-sprzedazy-b2b" data-astro-cid-j6ocf6pu><span data-astro-cid-j6ocf6pu>Dowiedz się więcej o AI dla sprzedaży</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" data-astro-cid-zgufigjl><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6" data-astro-cid-zgufigjl></path></svg></a></div><figure class="media" data-astro-cid-yr23l7fg><div class="dg" data-diagram="zw-ai-sales" aria-hidden="true" style="--dg-w: 760; --dg-h: 458.05;"><div class="zw-stage dg-stage"><div class="zw-fit dg-fit"><div class="zw-scene"><div class="zw-chat"><div class="zw-chat-head"><span class="zw-avatar"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4 L13.5 10.5 L20 12 L13.5 13.5 L12 20 L10.5 13.5 L4 12 L10.5 10.5 Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span><span class="zw-head-meta"><span class="zw-head-name">Sales Agent</span><span class="zw-head-status"><i class="zw-dot"></i>Online</span></span></div><div class="zw-chat-body"><div class="zw-msg zw-msg--agent" data-msg="brief"><div class="zw-bubble zw-bubble--agent"><span class="zw-eyebrow">Done today</span><ul class="zw-tasks"><li class="zw-task"><span class="zw-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5 l4 4 l9 -10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="zw-task-label">Researched 12 leads</span></li><li class="zw-task"><span class="zw-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5 l4 4 l9 -10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="zw-task-label">Drafted 4 follow-ups</span></li><li class="zw-task"><span class="zw-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5 l4 4 l9 -10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="zw-task-label">Cleaned CRM</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="zw-msg zw-msg--user" data-msg="user"><div class="zw-bubble zw-bubble--user">Draft offer for Acme</div></div><div class="zw-msg zw-msg--agent" data-msg="reply"><div class="zw-bubble zw-bubble--agent zw-reply"><div class="zw-typing" data-typing><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="zw-done" data-done><span class="zw-done-check"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5 l4 4 l9 -10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span class="zw-done-meta"><span class="zw-done-title">Offer ready</span><span class="zw-done-sub">Acme &middot; &euro;24,000</span></span></div></div></div></div><div class="zw-chat-input"><span 