ht="450" alt="Grzegorz Zawłodzki" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb><h3 id="kontakt-details" class="type-heading-s" data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb>Bezpośredni kontakt</h3><p data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb>Wyślij e-mail, napisz SMS lub zadzwoń.</p><ul class="channel-rows" role="list" data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb><li data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb><a class="with-icon" href="mailto:grzesiek@zawlodzki.pl" data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb><svg viewBox="0 0 20 16" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb><path d="M2 0h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V2a2 2 0 0 1 2-2m0 3v.5l8 5 8-5V3l-8 5z" data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb></path></svg><span data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb>grzesiek@zawlodzki.pl</span></a></li><li data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb><a class="with-icon" href="tel:+48571088338" data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb><svg viewBox="0 0 18 18" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb><path d="M3.6 7.8a15 15 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2a1 1 0 0 1 1-.25 11.4 11.4 0 0 0 3.6.57 1 1 0 0 1 1 1V17a1 1 0 0 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 0 1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3.5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1c0 1.25.2 2.45.57 3.57a1 1 0 0 1-.25 1z" data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb></path></svg><span data-astro-cid-mlmkznwb>+48 571 088 338</span></a></li></ul></aside></div></div></div></section><section id="newsletter" class="content-grid section newsletter" aria-labelledby="newsletter-heading" data-astro-cid-si2vdw3r><div class="inner" data-astro-cid-si2vdw3r><h2 id="newsletter-heading" class="type-heading-l" data-astro-cid-si2vdw3r="true">Newsletter <span class="accent" data-astro-cid-si2vdw3r>Sales Atlas</span></h2><p class="body" data-astro-cid-si2vdw3r>Raz w tygodniu dostaniesz bezpłatnie, jedno gotowe rozwiązanie, jak skutecznie wykorzystać nowoczesne technologie w sprzedaży B2B.</p><form id="newsletter-form" class="lead-form dark signup" action="/api/form?form=newsletter" method="post" data-lead-form data-form="newsletter" data-name="Newsletter bottom CTA form" data-astro-cid-gz6njkqh><div class="field" data-astro-cid-si2vdw3r><label class="visually-hidden" for="n